--- !u!114 &5276807572414251990
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1061985022400142655}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.7294118, g: 0.7411765, b: 0.73333335, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 10
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 1
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '05/08/26 - Version 11.6.80 Released

    - added: info for how to set
    up formation flying correctly in the editor

    - fixed: formation flying bug,
    follow ship not chasing down lead ship

    - fixed: can''t select choice using
    controller d-pad

    - updated: don''t allow exit menu during cutscene or mission
    briefing


    05/08/26 - Version 11.6.67 Released

    - added: make save string
    and if string equals node

    - added: choice node option

    - added: make
    input functions independent of smallship script

    - added: warning sound to
    player cockpit when ship is badly damaged

    - added: load lots of containers
    without slowing down game

    - added: new vong ships

    - added: hud functions
    for choice node

    - added: create ifchoicehasbeenmade node

    - added: finish
    putting textures on vong ships

    - added: create ship information for vong
    ships

    - updated: set controller senstivity in input settings when loading
    game

    - updated: set keyboard and mouse in input settings

    - updated:
    remove all OGinput references free from going through the smallship script

    -
    updated: make grabbing the reference to OGInput the first thing that the smallship
    does then

    - added: optional ''fadeout/fadein'' for hyperspace to imply the
    passing of time

    - updated: set up vong ships

    - updated: smoothing on
    mouse input

    - updated: make pitch on ships signifcantly stronger than turn

    -
    removed: rotation options from loadsingleshipfromhangar node

    - fixed: loadsingleshipfromhangar
    error

    - fixed: loadsingleshipfromhangar confusing type and launchship in
    mission functions

    - fixed: docking node null bug

    - fixed: null bug
    when destroying a ship exiting docking

    - updated: select closest hostile
    ship should not select docked ships

    - removed: howintheworld from credits

    -
    removed: skybox credits

    - updated: reduce resistance to impacts with largeships
    and asteroids

    - restored: yorik_miid to availible vong ships

    - updated:
    system level controls locked in new OGinput system

    - updated: strident_carrier
    in editor doesn''t load

    - updated: in editor make internal file false by
    default

    - updated: sith interceptor is wrongly listed as imperial

    -
    updated: acclamator_m3 is wrongly listed as imperial

    - updated: refinery_ship
    does not load in ship inspector

    - updated: sticks not working when controller
    is switched

    - updated: collision problem on frigate

    - updated: auto-aim
    window should be smaller

    - updated: chasemaster_frigate should be listed
    as a sith ship

    - updated: middle mouse button for laser on hud not right

    -
    updated: auto-aim should not run when targetting largeship

    - updated: auto-aim
    should be on by default'
